Parallax Portfolio Documentation


# Parallax Portfolio: Complete Development Guide

Machine Learning Engineer Portfolio with 3D Parallax Effect

## Executive Summary

This document provides a complete roadmap for building an advanced parallax portfolio website showcasing your machine learning and engineering background. The portfolio will feature a stunning 3D parallax mouse-tracking effect that creates an immersive, professional presentation of your projects and skills.

**Key Features:**
- 3D parallax effect with mouse tracking
- Reveal animations on page load
- Fully responsive design (desktop, tablet, mobile)
- Modern glassmorphism and gradient effects
- Project showcase section with machine learning focus
- Contact/CTA section
- PDF-downloadable portfolio documents

---

