└── README.md               # Project documentation


### 1.2 Required External Libraries

**For Parallax & Animation:**
- GSAP (GreenSock Animation Platform) - v3.12.2+
  - Smooth animations and tweening
  - MouseMove tracking
  - Timeline control
  - Link: https://greensock.com/gsap/

**For Icons:**
- Font Awesome v6.4+
  - SVG icons for social links, skills, etc.
  - Link: https://fontawesome.com/

**For Fonts:**
- Google Fonts (Poppins, Inter, or Space Mono)
  - Modern, clean typography
  - Link: https://fonts.google.com/

**For Responsive:**
- No external framework (vanilla CSS recommended)
- CSS Grid and Flexbox for layouts
- CSS custom properties for theming

