## Part 7: Development Workflow

### Phase 1: Asset Preparation (3-4 days)

**Tasks:**
1. [ ] Extract parallax layers from Photoshop
2. [ ] Optimize and compress images
3. [ ] Create project thumbnail images
4. [ ] Prepare icon assets
5. [ ] Create color palette and typography standards

### Phase 2: HTML & CSS (3-5 days)

**Tasks:**
1. [ ] Build semantic HTML structure
2. [ ] Implement responsive layouts (mobile-first)
3. [ ] Style components (buttons, cards, navbar)
4. [ ] Create parallax styling
5. [ ] Build responsive utilities

### Phase 3: JavaScript & Interactions (3-4 days)

**Tasks:**
1. [ ] Implement parallax effect
2. [ ] Add reveal animations
3. [ ] Build navigation interactions
4. [ ] Optimize performance
5. [ ] Test across browsers

### Phase 4: Content & Polish (2-3 days)

**Tasks:**
1. [ ] Write compelling copy
2. [ ] Add actual project descriptions
3. [ ] Implement contact form
4. [ ] Create PDF downloads
5. [ ] Add meta tags and SEO

### Phase 5: Testing & Deployment (2-3 days)

**Tasks:**
1. [ ] Responsive testing on devices
2. [ ] Performance optimization
3. [ ] Accessibility audit
4. [ ] Cross-browser testing
5. [ ] Deploy to GitHub Pages
6. [ ] Setup custom domain (optional)

